; Denies all userspace processes access to IPSec-related sockets.
; The userspace interface to IPSec kernel functionality is not needed on most
; desktop systems and was responsible for several major privilege escalation exploits.
; Source: https://github.com/secureblue/secureblue (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)

(in secureblue
    (call deny_userspace (key_socket))
    (call deny_userspace (netlink_xfrm_socket)))
